<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .header img {
      max-width: 300px;
      height: auto;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #1e40af;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    p { margin: 0 0 16px 0; }
    .ask {
      background-color: #eff6ff;
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      color: #1e40af;
    }
    .ask p { margin: 0; }
    .ask p + p {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #1e3a8a;
    }
    .ask .address {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .ask .address a { color: #1e40af; }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    .footer p { margin: 5px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <% if attachments['logo.png'] %>
      <img src="<%= attachments['logo.png'].url %>" alt="Hard Anodising Surface Treatments Ltd"
           width="300" style="width: 300px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <% else %>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 5px;">Hard Anodising Surface Treatments Ltd</h1>
    <% end %>
    <h1>A quick request about purchase orders</h1>
  </div>

  <p>Thank you for your order <strong><%= @customer_order.number %></strong>, which we are booking in now. Our formal acknowledgement will follow once it has been through contract review.</p>

  <p>
    <% case @origin %>
    <% when :paper %>
      This order reached us as a paper copy with the parts, so we scanned it in to book the work.
    <% when :manual %>
      This order was sent to one of our team's individual inboxes rather than to our shared orders mailbox.
    <% when :forwarded %>
      This order reached our orders mailbox from an address we don't have on file for you, which usually means it was passed on by one of our team.
    <% else %>
      This order reached us by a route other than our shared orders mailbox.
    <% end %>
    Both work, but they are slower and easier to miss than the address below.
  </p>

  <div class="ask">
    <p><strong>Please email a digital copy of every purchase order to</strong></p>
    <p class="address"><a href="mailto:<%= @orders_address %>"><%= @orders_address %></a></p>
    <p>This is a shared mailbox checked by the whole team. Orders sent there are picked up and
      booked in straight away, rather than waiting in an individual's inbox or for the parts
      to arrive. A PDF attached to the email is ideal. Please update your records and pass
      this address on to your purchasing team.</p>
  </div>

  <p><strong>Please still send paperwork with the goods.</strong> A copy of the purchase order or a
    delivery note quoting your PO number lets us match the parts to the order the moment they
    arrive.</p>

  <p>Thank you for your help with this.</p>

  <div class="footer">
    <p><strong>Why you're receiving this:</strong> this is an automated message, sent when an order reaches
      us other than by email from an address we hold for your company. If this order did come from you
      directly — for example from a purchasing system or a group address — just reply to let us know and
      we'll add that address to your account so you don't hear from us again.</p>
    <p>If you have any questions, please call us on 01562 747100 quoting order <%= @customer_order.number %>.</p>
    <br>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #1e40af;">Hard Anodising Surface Treatments Ltd</p>
    <p style="margin: 5px 0;">Firs Industrial Estate, Rickets Close, Kidderminster DY11 7QN</p>
    <p style="margin: 5px 0;">Tel: 01562 747100 | <a href="http://www.hard-anodising.co.uk" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none;">www.hard-anodising.co.uk</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
